and cheese","dish/macaroni-and-cheese"]]],["Canadian cuisine","cuisine/canadian-cuisine",[["Macaroni and cheese","dish/macaroni-and-cheese"]]],["English cuisine","cuisine/english-cuisine",[["Macaroni and cheese","dish/macaroni-and-cheese"]]]]},{"h":"Often cooked with","links":[["Butter","ingredient/butter"],["Cheddar cheese","ingredient/cheddar-cheese"],["Cheese","ingredient/cheese"],["Macaroni","ingredient/macaroni"],["Milk","ingredient/milk"],["Wheat flour","ingredient/wheat-flour"]]}],"img":{"src":"/labs/cuisines/img/thumb/9/9b/Flickr_stuart_spivack_173603796--Macaroni_and_cheese.jpg/500px-Flickr_stuart_spivack_173603796--Macaroni_and_cheese.jpg","w":500,"h":375,"by":"Stuart Spivack from Cleveland, Ohio, USA","lic":"CC BY-SA 2.0","licUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flickr_stuart_spivack_173603796--Macaroni_and_cheese.jpg"}},"dish/paling-in-t-groen":{"t":"dish","r":"dish/paling-in-t-groen","n":"Paling in 't groen","c":"#ede6da","crumb":[["Dishes","dishes"]],"sub":"Dish from Belgian cuisine","dot":"#cf5f87","intro":[["Paling in 't groen (Dutch) or Anguilles au vert (French) is a Belgian dish, mainly from the Flemish Region along the river Scheldt, between Dendermonde and Antwerp. The Dutch name (literally 'Eel in the Green')  refers to freshwater eel in a green herb sauce. The traditionally home-made meal is also sold fully prepared but still uncooked by some fishmongers' shops or market stalls, and can be enjoyed in specialty restaurants."]],"src":"wikipedia","actions":[{"kind":"globe","hash":"dish-paling-in-t-groen"},{"kind":"wiki","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paling_in_'t_groen"}],"sections":[{"h":"Where it's from","links":[["Belgian cuisine","cuisine/belgian-cuisine"]]},{"h":"More from Belgian cuisine","links":[["Algérienne sauce","dish/algerienne-sauce"],["Belgian chocolate","dish/belgian-chocolate"],["Bickyburger","dish/bickyburger"],["Boûkète","dish/boukete"],["Flemish stew","dish/